      "message": "Can we have a comment either one of \"because we haven\u0027t figured out how to move them yet\" or \"and it doesn\u0027t seem urgent to figure out how to move them yet\" or \"we can\u0027t move them yet because we\u0027re not on Python 3.2\"?\n\nhttp://stackoverflow.com/questions/3522079/changing-the-directory-where-pyc-files-are-created",
